target: internal/push/push.go
verify: go test ./internal/push/ -count=1 -run 'TestReportProbeAsksGitHubOverREST'
expect: with no branch there is no PR to read
why:    with no branch (a detached HEAD, git unable to say) there is no PR to look up, and asking anyway sends `head={owner}%3A` — an empty head, whose answer is GitHub's to interpret, not this gate's. Whatever comes back is not this branch's PR.
--- old
	if branch == "" {
		return "", false, ""
	}
--- new
